   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'She left and slammed the door.' Sokolov watches the door close after Marina's furious departure.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Да, сорвалась наша рыбка.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, our fish got away.' Lavrov uses a fishing metaphor for a suspect slipping off the hook.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Анатолий Иванович, вы были слишком жестоки.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Anatoly Ivanovich, you were too harsh.' Sokolov addresses his superior respectfully by name and patronymic.",
