  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Всё нормально, не переживай.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Everything is fine, don't worry.' Lavrov dismisses the lieutenant's scruples with calm arrogance.",
